reproduced below. BSD-3-Clause requires this notice be reproduced in binary
redistributions, which every released `oam` binary is.

V8 is pulled in as a prebuilt static library by the `v8` crate's build script,
so its license text appears nowhere in the cargo dependency graph and cannot be
collected by `cargo about`. It is reproduced here from
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/v8/v8/main/LICENSE and must be refreshed if
the embedded V8 version changes.

This license applies to all parts of V8 that are not externally
